Kroger's net earnings attributable to The Kroger Co. for fiscal 2024 (the year ended February 1, 2025) were $2,665 million, up 23.2% from $2,164 million in the prior year [1]. On a per-share basis, that equated to $3.67 per diluted common share [1].

The filing also reports an adjusted figure that excludes certain items such as merger-related costs and investment losses: $3,246 million [2]. The $2,665 million figure is the reported net earnings attributable to the company. The filing's passages don't give a separate net income figure that includes any noncontrolling interests.